OL,3,GNEWSALetter from 1955 found during
OL,4,Ahouse renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who discovered in the walls of
OL,7,Fhis house a letter written by a
OL,8,Ftradesman 71 years ago says he wants to
OL,9,Ffind out more about the person who left
OL,10,Fit there.
OL,12,FBrendon Swallow has lived in his
OL,13,Fproperty in Welton, East Yorkshire, for
OL,14,F13 years, but he found the letter only
OL,15,Fwhile renovating his house last week.
OL,17,FThe letter, which was wrapped up in an
OL,18,Fold newspaper, was addressed to the
OL,19,Ffinder and signed by electrician Gordon
OL,20,FHopper on 1 March 1955.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
