OL,3,GNEWSALetter from 1955 found during
OL,4,Ahouse renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's very nice that he took the time
OL,7,Fto write that, and it's great to be
OL,8,Fable to bring it out so people can see
OL,9,Fit, because that's obviously what he
OL,10,Fwould have wanted when he wrote it,"
OL,11,Fsaid Swallow.
